#. Description of the plugin
#: store-migrator-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "Migrate a Shopify store into WooCommerce — products, variants and images from a CSV export (free), plus collections, customers, orders, coupons and 301 redirects (premium). Batched with Action Scheduler and resumable."
msgstr ""

